+- **Captured tag set.** The captured tag set is every ref under `refs/tags/`
+  in the observed repository's object database at the capture instant, each
+  paired with the commit it peels to.
+  - It is a deterministic evaluation input with an identity of its own, so
+    two evaluations of one revision whose captured tag sets differ are two
+    evaluations.
+  - Only ref names and object ids are taken from it; no tag message or
+    signature is read into the model or rendered.
+  - A tag reaches the revision when the commit it peels to is the revision or
+    an ancestor of it. Its distance is the number of commits in the
